Mod for No Man's Sky that allows players to offer a configurable amount of alien gifts in one interaction, while also allowing the user to choose if they want the dialogue screen with the alien to stay open.

[size=4][b]Downloading[/b][/size]

The only places this mod should be downloaded from are:

[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4774]Nexus Mods[/url]
[*][url=https://github.com/scottdraper8/generous-giver/releases]GitHub release page[/url]
[/list]

[quote][b]Warning[/b]

Official downloads are available only from Nexus Mods and GitHub Releases. Please report copies found elsewhere so their license compliance can be reviewed.[/quote]

[size=4][b]Installing[/b][/size]

Install the archive with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/vortex]Vortex[/url] or [url=https://github.com/ChrisDKN/Amethyst-Mod-Manager]Amethyst Mod Manager[/url]. Choose a gift amount and dialogue behavior in the FOMOD, then deploy.

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scottdraper8/generous-giver/refs/heads/main/assets/fomod.png[/img][/center]

[quote][b]Note[/b]

This mod modifies the following files:

[list]
[*]METADATA/REALITY/TABLES/COSTTABLE.EXML
[*]METADATA/REALITY/TABLES/REWARDTABLE.EXML
[*]METADATA/REALITY/TABLES/NMS_DIALOG_GCALIENPUZZLETABLE.EXML
[/list][/quote]
